Guido Serassio <guidos1966@yahoo.com> wrote:

> "Rake@Q3" wrote:

>> Anyone who installed RH7.1 via MILO on a XL266 is lying and full of crap.

> I have just finished to install RHL7.0 via MILO 2.2-17 (found on RHL 7.1 cd ..)
